/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.profraw
/lcov.info
/web/node_modules
/web/dist
.DS_Store
# cargo-mutants working directories. The report is read and acted on, never
# checked in — it is about a diff, and a diff does not survive the branch.
/mutants.out
/mutants.out.old
# libFuzzer's working directories. The seeds in `fuzz/seeds/` are checked in;
# the corpus it grows from them is thousands of files and regenerable.
/fuzz/corpus
/fuzz/artifacts
/fuzz/target
# Python bytecode from `just scripts`. Regenerated on every run, and a
# `.pyc` from one interpreter is noise to every other — two of them landed on
# `main` in #56, one per Python version this machine had.
__pycache__/
